{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'...no. But. I'm dealing better. I told Irynx about Katrine and didn't even blame myself where I shouldn't have... I've buried my own body. I c-can handle this...'","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:06:52.810000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879441583789977640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
