{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Also, that reminds me, I had that idea, and it might sound a bit odd. What do you want to do with the Nightingale and the Nimble after all this?\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:18:05.935000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879444407080878161","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'...with the Nightingale, hmm... I was thinking of turning it into a shelter. But if you have any idea which needs airship parts specifically, then I could always make a shelter through other means...'","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:19:13.869000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879444692016713819","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Ed just shrugs \"I might sell it for some coin... we do have a plan to travel, don't we? that will require funds\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:30:23.086000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879447498916257822","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Well, I'm not that good at this whole prayer thing, so today I just pretty much gave Gil an update and mentioned I had something in mind to try to work out, but might as well tell you, and he'll probably know.\"\n\n\"I plan to disassemble the Aphid.\"\n\n\"I've had quite a lot of time to figure out how its engines work, so I could probably make them power something else, like for example pumps. With the planks from the hull, the engines powering the pumps, and some filtering, I could set up some water purifying station on the Hudson. The damnation from Hampstead seems gone, but a lot of nasty stuff still found its way to the river and stuck in it. I think starting cleaning the river flowing through the biggest city on this coast of Arcania might be a good first step for the followers of the Warden of the Waters.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:32:10.253000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879447948407238676","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'That's... I'll absolutely contribute the Nightingale to that.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:34:11.908000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879448458665283604","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"I'll probably need to have a chat with Edriata, as she still lives there, after all. I hope she'll see the benefit in this and won't ask me for anything.\"\n(aka I already mentioned this idea to Mariam)","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:35:59.058000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879448908084949022","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'I'll help. I... wouldn't call us friends, but definitely casual acquaintances.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:37:11.488000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879449211878375455","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
