{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"(Roy accepts) \"Thanks. I just had a thought that going west we won't really have much use for airships, with no ports to dock or maintain them. And as for a place to stay whenever we're back in the city, well, we are in one right now. The Aphid has served me well, even without growing like the Voice or the Ball Eater did. Why not let it keep being of use in a new form. You don't need to donate your ships for this if you feel attached to them or have other plans for them, but if you do, I'll do my best to give them a second life.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:46:19.379000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879451509899808799","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'I... haven't had a good use for the Nightingale since I was undead. I'm glad I can give it a better use than that.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:49:12.665000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879452236713951273","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Like in Nature, they will get given new purpose... it sounds like a really swell idea to me\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:49:46.224000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-23T19:49:53.182000Z","id":"879452377470631997","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
