{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Starting the plan will probably have to wait till the armada's dealt with, so nobody bombs my work in progress. And hey, if the ships are hit, it'll make it easier with the disassembly. I did have a look at how the beast of an engine of the Voice runs a few times, I think I might have an idea for how to make the pump contraption.\"\n(I actually straight out did ic write wandering into the Voice's engine room to just check out the engines, long before coming up with this)","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:58:49.505000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879454656156278844","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'Understandable. I'm not sure how much I can help with the building part of it, but... I or Kukudh can always go errand running for parts if you need.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T20:00:35.245000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879455099662008420","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
